<!doctype html>
<html lang="ru"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>GhostPLUS — рекламное изображение</title><style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{width:1400px;height:560px;margin:0;overflow:hidden}body{position:relative;background:#101014;color:#f4f1fc;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif}body:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 50%,#7447bf38,transparent 48%),radial-gradient(ellipse at 3% 0%,#b39af410,transparent 60%)}main{position:relative;height:100%;padding:64px 80px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.copy{position:relative;z-index:2}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;font-size:30px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-1px}.brand img{width:48px;height:48px}.brand span{color:#b39af4}h1{margin:38px 0 20px;font-size:66px;line-height:1.12;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-2.8px}h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#bda6f7}p{margin:0;color:#aaa5b6;font-size:21px;letter-spacing:.1px}.art{position:relative;flex:0 0 410px;width:410px;height:410px;display:grid;place-items:center}.ring{position:absolute;border:1px solid #b39af41c;border-radius:50%;width:400px;height:400px}.ring.inner{width:306px;height:306px;border-color:#b39af42d;background:radial-gradient(circle,#b39af416,transparent 70%)}.symbol{position:relative;width:196px;height:196px;filter:drop-shadow(0 20px 50px #0008)}.dot{position:absolute;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#bda6f7;box-shadow:0 0 24px #b39af478;top:59px;right:63px}.dot.small{width:7px;height:7px;top:auto;right:auto;bottom:73px;left:48px;opacity:.65}.line{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:80px;right:80px;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#b39af430,transparent)}
</style></head><body><main><div class="copy"><div class="brand"><img src="../icons/icon128.png" alt=""><div>Ghost<span>PLUS</span></div></div><h1>Знакомый Ghost.<br><em>Удобнее на ПК.</em></h1><p>Привычный стиль. Больше удобства.</p></div><div class="art"><div class="ring"></div><div class="ring inner"></div><img class="symbol" src="../icons/icon128.png" alt=""><i class="dot"></i><i class="dot small"></i></div></main><div class="line"></div></body></html>
